<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    Technique paths in the VPE model (docs/DISENO_CORE.md): five levels per path, one point per technique. Elemental
    paths (Techniques.xml) open with the spirit root; these extra paths open with a jade slip (Sword, Spirit Sense) or by
    following the body path (Vajra Body). Level 4 = Golden Core; level 5 waits for the Nascent Soul.
  -->
  <Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
    <defName>CVG_Manual_SwordHeart</defName>
    <label>Sword Heart Canon</label>
    <description>The canon of the Sword Peak of Jiuxiao, where disciples slept with their swords and spoke to no one else. It does not care about the root: any cultivator can walk the way of the sword. Flying swords, a heart sharp as an edge and, at Foundation, a sword intent that cuts before the blade is drawn.</description>
    <path>CVG_Path_Qi</path>
    <requiredResearch>CVG_Research_TechniqueManuals</requiredResearch>
    <order>6</order>
    <fromJadeSlips>true</fromJadeSlips>
    <cardTexPath>UI/Paths/CVG_Path_Sword</cardTexPath>
    <iconPath>UI/Techniques/CVG_Tech_SwordQiSweep</iconPath>
  </Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
  <Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
    <defName>CVG_Manual_SpiritSense</defName>
    <label>Spirit Sense Sutra</label>
    <description>A sutra of the mountain temples of Jiuxiao on the shen, the spirit sense that a cultivator spreads around like ripples. It trains the mind, not the meridians: a calm heart, eyes that see through the dust of battle.</description>
    <path>CVG_Path_Qi</path>
    <requiredResearch>CVG_Research_TechniqueManuals</requiredResearch>
    <order>7</order>
    <fromJadeSlips>true</fromJadeSlips>
    <cardTexPath>UI/Paths/CVG_Path_Soul</cardTexPath>
    <iconPath>UI/Techniques/CVG_Tech_QiShield</iconPath>
  </Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
  <Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
    <defName>CVG_Manual_VajraBody</defName>
    <label>Vajra Body Method</label>
    <description>The path of those who temper flesh instead of qi. Buddhist monks of the old world called the indestructible body vajra, diamond; the body cultivators of Jiuxiao made it a method. Every body cultivator walks it from the first day of tempering.</description>
    <path>CVG_Path_Body</path>
    <order>8</order>
    <openedByFollowing>CVG_Path_Body</openedByFollowing>
    <fromJadeSlips>false</fromJadeSlips>
    <cardTexPath>UI/Paths/CVG_Path_Body</cardTexPath>
    <iconPath>UI/Techniques/CVG_Tech_MountainBody</iconPath>
  </Convergence.TechniqueManualDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="CVG_TechniqueBulletBase">
    <defName>CVG_Projectile_FlyingSword</defName>
    <label>flying sword</label>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Projectile/CVG/FlyingSword</texPath>
